{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Bob, a big-headed sleepyhead, but this time when you wake up, everything has changed.  <br>Opening your foggy eyes, you find that your memories seem to have been stolen, leaving your mind completely blank. The room is pitch black; all the lights are off. Don't panic, Bob! With your head\u2014both comical and incredibly practical\u2014embark on a journey filled with puzzles, traps, and adventure!  <br><strong>Four batteries, four lights \u2013 the truth awaits you just ahead.</strong></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Shake off your daze, Bob, for destiny awaits you!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the right moment, using your &quot;big head&quot; can trigger a perfect dodge, along with many additional effects.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420590/extras/ccd4e8b048d0330b82e5c2cd2c3d41e8.poster.avif?t=1757937453\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420590/extras/ccd4e8b048d0330b82e5c2cd2c3d41e8.webm?t=1757937453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420590/extras/ccd4e8b048d0330b82e5c2cd2c3d41e8.mp4?t=1757937453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make full use of your dodge ability to pull off many incredible maneuvers.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420590/extras/723d7730331a0bef78aeca9b4d9184d6.poster.avif?t=1757937453\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420590/extras/723d7730331a0bef78aeca9b4d9184d6.webm?t=1757937453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420590/extras/723d7730331a0bef78aeca9b4d9184d6.mp4?t=1757937453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Objectives</strong></p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure, combat, puzzles, and the collection of 4 batteries to uncover the truth behind your lost memories!</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420590/extras/881f5204eeccef580281e8c8e3bdfce7.poster.avif?t=1757937453\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420590/extras/881f5204eeccef580281e8c8e3bdfce7.webm?t=1757937453\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3420590/extras/881f5204eeccef580281e8c8e3bdfce7.mp4?t=1757937453\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, in this game, you can also experience:</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Diverse Range of Gameplay Experiences</strong></p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/34